{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"replace","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"with","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"other","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto4ItemV","text":"Item","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Item"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The item to put in this one’s place.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"other"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/WritingRules"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Prefer it over "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vanish()"},{"type":"text","text":" plus a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"move"},{"type":"text","text":", which cannot do the same job."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Item\/location"},{"type":"text","text":" answers the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"room","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" an item is in, which is all a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"move(to:)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can aim at — so a hand-rolled swap drops the replacement on the floor"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when the original was sitting in a sack. The placement itself is what"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"carries across here, hands and containers included."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"other"},{"type":"text","text":" inherits the placement and nothing else. It does not inherit"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"worn state, so replacing something you are wearing leaves you holding"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the replacement rather than wearing it. Contents do not come across"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"either: whatever was inside this item leaves play with it, so a caller"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"meaning to salvage cargo moves it out first."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vanish()"},{"type":"text","text":", and unlike "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Item\/move(to:)"},{"type":"text","text":", this does not carry a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"boarded player — a vehicle swapped out from under its passenger leaves"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them standing where they were."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Replacing an item with itself does nothing."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Item\/replace(with:)"},"metadata":{"title":"replace(with:)","symbolKind":"method","externalID":"s:6Gnusto4ItemV7replace4withyAC_tF","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"name":"Gnusto"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"replace","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"with","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto4ItemV","text":"Item","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Item"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Puts ","type":"text"},{"code":"other","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" exactly where this item is — the same room, hands,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"contain